<title>POLAND: ECHO RIGHTS FIRST LEG 99.3 PCT SUBSCRIBED.</title>
<headline>ECHO RIGHTS FIRST LEG 99.3 PCT SUBSCRIBED.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors subscribed for 1.488.811 shares or 99.3 percent of Polish developer firm Echo Investment first leg of its rights issue, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Earlier the company said that if in the first leg not all shares were subscribed shareholders would be able to subscribe for the remaining shares from December 16, 1996 to January 2, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
